    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46766" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭpĕr-īnĭcĭo</span></b> ,
		no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
				jectum, 3, v. a., <i>to
				throw on</i> or <i>above</i>, <i>to
				cast over</i> or <i>upon</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">raras frondes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 4, 46</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">textum rude,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					8, 640</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. F.
					5, 533</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">togas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 6, 570</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folia contrita et illita,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 5, 26, 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fimum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 9, 6, § 53</span></i>
			.</div>
